sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AgentController
    participant ChatClient
    participant ChatMemory
    participant LocalTools as AgentTools and DocumentationTools
    participant McpTools as MCP ToolCallbackProvider
    participant Ollama

    Client->>AgentController: POST /api/agent/chat {message, conversationId?}
    AgentController->>AgentController: Resolve conversationId<br/>blank -> "default"
    AgentController->>ChatClient: prompt().user(message)<br/>advisors(conversationId)
    ChatClient->>ChatMemory: Load/update conversation window
    Note over ChatClient,Ollama: ChatModelLoggingAspect logs prompt, response, and token usage around model calls
    ChatClient->>Ollama: Send prompt with system prompt and advisors

    alt Model chooses a local tool
        Ollama-->>ChatClient: Tool call request
        ChatClient->>LocalTools: Invoke @Tool method
        LocalTools-->>ChatClient: Tool result
        ChatClient->>Ollama: Continue with tool result
    end

    alt Model chooses a reachable MCP tool
        Ollama-->>ChatClient: Tool call request
        ChatClient->>McpTools: Invoke MCP tool callback
        McpTools-->>ChatClient: Tool result
        ChatClient->>Ollama: Continue with tool result
    end

    Ollama-->>ChatClient: Final answer
    ChatClient-->>AgentController: Response content
    AgentController-->>Client: {conversationId, response}
